(10, 'Smart IT & AI Solutions for Modern Businesses', 'We help organizations run smoothly with reliable IT operations, practical AI, and secure systems. Reduce downtime, automate daily work, and gain real-time insights that help your team make faster, smarter decisions.', 'banner_uploads/banner_698eff61104e4.jpg'),
(11, 'YOUR VISION, OUR SOLUTION BUILDING TOMORROW TOGETHER.', 'Xpansion Technology is a global full-service digital partner, blending strategy, experience design,  engineering, and managed services. We create digital solutions that  drive real impact today while   laying the groundwork for future growth.             ', 'banner_uploads/banner_698f01f967a5f.jpg');

